      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This post shows how to go a step further: run it as a remote agent on Amazon Bedrock AgentCore, a platform to build, connect, and optimize agents at scale, with any framework or model.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/extend-claude-code-to-remote-sessions-on-amazon-bedrock-agentcore-with-security-controls/",
