      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We first discuss why teams choose Amazon Bedrock for Claude Code and highlight a few key security characteristics.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/extend-claude-code-to-remote-sessions-on-amazon-bedrock-agentcore-with-security-controls/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T16:45:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-06T17:28:28.248Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Claude Code calls Amazon Bedrock with temporary AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) credentials, and you can sign in through an identity provider such as Microsoft Entra ID or Okta by following the Guidance for Claude Code with Amazon Bedrock .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/extend-claude-code-to-remote-sessions-on-amazon-bedrock-agentcore-with-security-controls/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T16:45:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-06T17:28:28.248Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "An AWS Lambda function screens the task prompt with an Amazon Bedrock Guardrails guardrail, then records the task in Amazon DynamoDB and puts it on an Amazon Simple Queue Service (Amazon SQS) queue.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/extend-claude-code-to-remote-sessions-on-amazon-bedrock-agentcore-with-security-controls/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T16:45:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-06T17:28:28.248Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Next, Claude Code plans the change with Claude Opus on Amazon Bedrock.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/extend-claude-code-to-remote-sessions-on-amazon-bedrock-agentcore-with-security-controls/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T16:45:58.000Z",
